# speed/linux-x86-64-amd-epyc — what the compiler costs, measured by `wisp cost`

[build]
clock analyze 1742 band 25%+250 target 5000
clock emit 983 band 25%+250 target 5000
clock keep 6704 band 25%+250 target 5000 over avra-lane-r2-first-paint .112.26
clock link 1829 band 25%+250 target 5000
clock lower 2491 band 25%+250 target 5000

[check]
clock analyze 1768 band 25%+250 target 5000
clock keep 6835 band 25%+250 target 5000 over avra-lane-r2-first-paint .112.26
clock lower 2568 band 25%+250 target 5000
